00:27.039" end="00:28.574"><span begin="00:27.039" end="00:27.248">I'm </span><span begin="00:27.248" end="00:27.687">jealous </span><span begin="00:27.687" end="00:27.946">of </span><span begin="00:27.946" end="00:28.165">the </span><span begin="00:28.165" end="00:28.574">rain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.059" end="00:32.894"><span begin="00:31.059" end="00:31.298">I'm </span><span begin="00:31.298" end="00:31.917">jealous </span><span begin="00:31.917" end="00:32.136">of </span><span begin="00:32.136" end="00:32.375">the </span><span begin="00:32.375" end="00:32.894">wind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.979" end="00:36.784"><span begin="00:34.979" end="00:35.218">That </span><span begin="00:35.218" end="00:35.627">ripples </span><span begin="00:35.627" end="00:35.996">through </span><span begin="00:35.996" end="00:36.245">your </span><span begin="00:36.245" end="00:36.784">clothes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.049" end="00:40.714"><span begin="00:39.049" end="00:39.268">It's </span><span begin="00:39.268" end="00:39.527">closer </span><span begin="00:39.527" end="00:39.786">than </span><span begin="00:39.786" end="00:40.105">your </span><span begin="00:40.105" end="00:40.714">shadow</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.929" end="00:44.832"><span begin="00:42.929" end="00:43.168">Oh </span><span begin="00:43.168" end="00:43.377">I'm </span><span begin="00:43.377" end="00:43.656">jealous </span><span begin="00:43.656" end="00:43.945">of </span><span begin="00:43.945" end="00:44.074">the </span><span begin="00:44.074" end="00:44.313">wind </span><span begin="00:44.313" end="00:44.832">cause</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.049" end="00:51.072"><span begin="00:48.049" end="00:48.288">I </span><span begin="00:48.288" end="00:48.507">wished </span><span begin="00:48.507" end="00:50.135">you </span><span begin="00:50.135" end="00:50.354">the </span><span begin="00:50.354" end="00:50.613">best </span><span begin="00:50.613" end="00:51.072">of</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.118" end="00:54.823"><span begin="00:52.118" end="00:52.747">All </span><span begin="00:52.747" end="00:52.976">this </span><span begin="00:52.976" end="00:53.755">world </span><span begin="00:53.755" end="00:54.044">could </span><span begin="00:54.044" end="00:54.823">give</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.748" end="00:58.800"><span begin="00:55.748" end="00:55.957">And </span><span begin="00:55.957" end="00:56.166">I </span><span begin="00:56.166" end="00:56.375">told </span><span begin="00:56.375" end="00:57.574">you </span><span begin="00:57.574" end="00:57.793">when </span><span begin="00:57.793" end="00:58.062">you </span><span begin="00:58.062" end="00:58.321">left </span><span begin="00:58.321" end="00:58.800">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.608" end="01:02.303"><span begin="00:59.608" end="00:59.837">There's </span><span begin="00:59.837" end="01:00.946">nothing </span><span begin="01:00.946" end="01:01.375">to </span><span begin="01:01.375" end="01:02.303">forgive</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.047" end="01:07.784"><span begin="01:03.047" end="01:03.306">But </span><span begin="01:03.306" end="01:03.545">I </span><span begin="01:03.545" end="01:03.774">always </span><span begin="01:03.774" end="01:04.073">thought </span><span begin="01:04.073" end="01:04.302">you'd </span><span begin="01:04.302" end="01:04.611">come </span><span begin="01:04.611" end="01:05.160">back </span><span begin="01:05.160" end="01:05.439">tell </span><span begin="01:05.439" end="01:06.158">me </span><span begin="01:06.158" end="01:06.417">all </span><span begin="01:06.417" end="01:06.706">you </span><span begin="01:06.706" end="01:07.165">found </span><span begin="01:07.165" end="01:07.784">was</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.667" end="01:10.683"><span begin="01:08.667" end="01:09.875">Heartbreak </span><span begin="01:09.875" end="01:10.164">and </span><span begin="01:10.164" end="01:10.683">misery</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.236" end="01:14.585"><span begin="01:11.236" end="01:11.555">It's </span><span begin="01:11.555" end="01:11.784">hard </span><span begin="01:11.784" end="01:12.003">for </span><span begin="01:12.003" end="01:12.212">me </span><span begin="01:12.212" end="01:12.431">to </span><span begin="01:12.431" end="01:13.170">say </span><span begin="01:13.170" end="01:13.489">I'm </span><span begin="01:13.489" end="01:13.738">jealous </span><span begin="01:13.738" end="01:13.967">of </span><span begin="01:13.967" end="01:14.306">the </span><span begin="01:14.306" end="01:14.585">way</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.126" end="01:16.652"><span begin="01:15.126" end="01:15.445">You're </span><span begin="01:15.445" end="01:15.774">happy </span><span begin="01:15.774" end="01:16.223">without </span><span begin="01:16.223" end="01:16.652">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.279" end="01:52.854"><span begin="01:51.279" end="01:51.598">I'm </span><span begin="01:51.598" end="01:52.027">jealous </span><span begin="01:52.027" end="01:52.276">of </span><span begin="01:52.276" end="01:52.495">the </span><span begin="01:52.495" end="01:52.854">nights</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.169" end="01:56.723"><span begin="01:55.169" end="01:55.418">That </span><span begin="01:55.418" end="01:55.647">I </span><span begin="01:55.647" end="01:55.866">don't </span><span begin="01:55.866" end="01:56.065">spend </span><span begin="01:56.065" end="01:56.354">with </span><span begin="01:56.354" end="01:56.723">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.119" end="02:01.242"><span begin="01:59.119" end="01:59.348">I'm </span><span begin="01:59.348" end="01:59.867">wondering </span><span begin="01:59.867" end="02:00.166">who </span><span begin="02:00.166" end="02:00.405">you </span><span begin="02:00.405" end="02:00.624">lay </span><span begin="02:00.624" end="02:00.863">next </span><span begin="02:00.863" end="02:01.242">to</spa